          "title": "Einwerfen",
          "subtitle": "Trick-taking",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Einwerfen, also called Zahlspiel, is a German eight-card point-trick game for four players in two partnerships."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Einwerfen is described as a basic German point-trick partnership game using a 32-card German-suited pack and sharing structural similarities with the Portuguese game Sueca."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "4 in two teams players use the table arrangement described for Einwerfen."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "32-card German-suited pack"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "32-card German-suited pack, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Deal eight cards to each player from a 32-card German pack."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
